# The repository root forces LF on every file, but cmd.exe is unreliable when
# reading a batch file with LF-only line endings -- `goto` labels in
# particular may fail to resolve. Override it for the Windows launchers.
#
# This file lives inside `src/` so `release.sh` rsyncs it into the release
# repository, where it has to apply as well.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
